    "resolved": "NOTE:",
    "formula": null,
    "cached_value_present": null
  },
  {
    "cell": "B3",
    "type": "s",
    "style_id": 12,
    "raw_v": "741",
    "resolved": "1. Data measured from a 12.8 m long composite beam test conducted at National Fire Research Laboratory (NFRL) at the National Institute of Standard and Technology (NIST) is provided here. A total of 5 Specimens were tested.  Table 1 provided below shows the Test Matrix. ",
    "formula": null,
    "cached_value_present": null
  },
  {
    "cell": "B4",
    "type": "s",
    "style_id": 12,
    "raw_v": "746",
    "resolved": "2. This file \"NFRL_CompositeBeamTest_TestSetup_and_InstrumentationLayout\" provides the test setup drawings and instrumentation layouts.",
    "formula": null,
    "cached_value_present": null
  },
  {
    "cell": "B5",
    "type": "s",
    "style_id": 12,
    "raw_v": "760",
    "resolved": "3. In this Excel file, Tab \"TestSetupDrawings\" provides the drawings depicting the test setup.   ",
    "formula": null,
    "cached_value_present": null
  },
  {
    "cell": "B6",
    "type": "s",
    "style_id": 12,
    "raw_v": "742",
    "resolved": "4. Tab \"InstrumentationLayout-AmbTest\" provides the instrumentation layout for the test of Specimen CB-DA-AMB conducted at ambient temperature.   ",
    "formula": null,
    "cached_value_present": null
  },
  {
    "cell": "B7",
    "type": "s",
    "style_id": 12,
    "raw_v": "747",
    "resolved": "5. Tab \"InstrumentationLayout-FireTests\" provides the instrumentation layout for the strcutural fire tests (Specimens CB-DA, CB-DA-SC, CB-SP, and CB-SP-SC).   ",
    "formula": null,
    "cached_value_present": null
  },
  {
    "cell": "B8",
    "type": "s",
    "style_id": 12,
    "raw_v": "748",
    "resolved": "6. Tab \"Channel List-AmbientTest\" provides a list of the sensors used in the test of Specimen CB-DA-AMB and their labels, locations, and the measurement units.   ",
    "formula": null,
    "cached_value_present": null
  },
  {
    "cell": "B9",
    "type": "s",
    "style_id": 12,
    "raw_v": "749",
    "resolved": "7. Tab \"Channel List-FireTests\" provides a list of the sensors used in strcutural fire tests (Specimens CB-DA, CB-DA-SC, CB-SP, and CB-SP-SC) and their labels, locations, and the measurement units.   ",
    "formula": null,
    "cached_value_present": null
  },
  {
    "cell": "B10",
    "type": "s",
    "style_id": 12,
    "raw_v": "750",
    "resolved": "8. The files \"CB-DA-AMP\", \"CB-DA\", \"CB-DA-SC\", \"CB-SP\", and \"CB-SP-SC\" provides the data measured during the tests of Specimens CB-DA-AMB, CB-DA, CB-DA-SC, CB-SP, and CB-SP-SC, respectively.   ",
    "formula": null,
    "cached_value_present": null
  },
  {
    "cell": "B11",
    "type": "s",
    "style_id": 12,
    "raw_v": "773",
    "resolved": "9. Refer to Choe et al. (2019) and Ramesh et al. (2019) for detailed descriptions of the test program, test results, and measurement uncertainties.",
    "formula": null,
    "cached_value_present": null
  },
  {
